    "id": "prop:worked-three-period-witness",
    "kind": "proposition",
    "statement": "In \\(\\mathsf E_3\\), all realized outcomes are positive, \\(q=1\\), \\(\\theta_{\\mathrm{PTT}}=1/2\\), \\(V^{\\star}=395643/6246400\\), \\(\\operatorname{Var}(h_{\\mathrm{CM}}^{\\prime}Z)=6663/102400\\), and \\(\\Gamma=27/15616\\); hence the cohort-mean PPML variance exceeds the bound by approximately \\(2.73\\) percent of \\(V^{\\star}\\).",
    "free_symbols": [
      "Ex3",
      "Y",
      "q",
